// The Blank's islands (bible 4.7, 8.6, 10: "the Blank is built from your choices"). Every place Wren left to the
// Blank drifts here, and its people react to how she left it. Five are authored, one per [B] commission (Islands);
// any other released place speaks from Island_Remnant.
// Remnant voice (style guide §4): half-sentences, present tense, polite; ask whether you've eaten; never "I'm dead".

title: Island_Merrow_Dotha
---
<<if has_flag("blank.merrow.visited")>>
    Dotha: Eleven. Still eleven. The water's a better audience here. #still
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Dotha: You. Sit if you're sitting.
Dotha: Eleven songs. I have all eleven here. The two that went with people came back with them.
<<if flag("saltmarrow.dotha.decided") == 2>>
    Dotha: You let it go. Kind. You said so, and it was.
<<else>>
    Dotha: Nobody held it. So here it is. Roofs and all. Forty of them.
<<endif>>
-> Sing me the eleventh.
    Dotha: It's about a stranger on the stoop. It's short. Everything true is.
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> Do you want to come back?
    Dotha: I don't ask twice. I asked once. You answered.
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ...
    Dotha: Quiet one. The white likes you too.
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.merrow.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Hollowvein
---
<<if has_flag("blank.hollowvein.visited")>>
    <<if has_flag("blank.hollowvein.called")>>
        Brask: Thirty-one. Answered. Tell Runa we heard. #still
    <<else>>
        Brask: Still listening. Have you eaten? #still
    <<endif>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Brask: Is it the roll-call? We've been listening for it. Thirty-one of us, standing.
Brask: Nobody's called us. Have you eaten? There's nothing. You're welcome to it.
-> I know the roll-call. <<if walk_known()>>
    Brask: Then call it. We'll answer. Every one.
    Mine: Thirty-one names, into the white. Thirty-one answers, out of it.
    <<flag blank.hollowvein.called 1>>
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> Runa counts you every night.
    Brask: Runa? Kettil's girl? She was this high. She counts us?
    Brask: Then we're counted. That's something. That's a lot.
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> ...
    Brask: That's what the Guild said too. Sit, anyway.
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.hollowvein.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Aldermere
---
<<if has_flag("blank.aldermere.visited")>>
    Hollin: Still tonight. Still bread. Come back any time; it's tonight. #still
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Hollin: Cartographer! You came to the festival. It's still tonight. It's tonight all night.
Hollin: Have you eaten? There's bread. There's bread till morning, and morning's a long way.
Hollin: We would rather be remembered than kept. And you remembered. Look at us.
-> It's a good festival.
    Hollin: The best. We only had the one. We made it last.
    <<voice drift blank>>
-> Teodor sits with you every evening.
    Hollin: Teodor! Tell him the bread's still warm. Tell him he was right.
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> Do you want to be held?
    Hollin: Held? We're dancing. Ask me after. There isn't an after. Ha!
    <<voice warden blank>>
<<flag blank.aldermere.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Inn
---
<<if has_flag("blank.inn.visited")>>
    Innkeeper: The same soup. Sit. #still
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Innkeeper: Traveller. The road brought you. It does, one night in a long while.
Innkeeper: Have you eaten? The soup is the same soup. Nobody minds. Sit.
-> Who else is on the road?
    Innkeeper: Everyone who took it. Nobody who's coming. Salt?
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> I came through the gate. Again.
    Innkeeper: Twice! A regular. We'll keep your chair.
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ...
    Innkeeper: Quiet ones eat more. Here.
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.inn.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Lowmarket
---
<<if has_flag("blank.lowmarket.visited")>>
    Brisk: The mill turns. Nobody's paid. Nobody's owed. #still
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Brisk: Journeyman. You stayed out. Fair. It wasn't your strike.
Brisk: No owners here. No wages. No survey. Just the mill, turning, and us.
Brisk: Have you eaten? There's paper. You can't eat paper. Force of habit.
-> Are you glad?
    Brisk: Nobody's owed anything here. I thought I'd like it more.
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> I should have stepped in.
    Brisk: Maybe. We'd have been kept, then. Same bread forever. Pick your forever.
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ...
    Brisk: Aye. The mill says that too.
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.lowmarket.visited 1>>
===

title: Island_Remnant
---
Remnant: Oh. A visitor. We don't— have you eaten?
Remnant: This is a place. It was on a map, once. You drew it, maybe. #still
-> I left it unanchored.
    Remnant: Then it's here. That's where unanchored goes. It's not bad. It's quiet.
    <<voice surveyor blank>>
-> Do you want to come back?
    Remnant: Back? We're here. Where's back?
    <<voice warden blank>>
-> ...
    Remnant: Yes. Like that. Sit a while.
    <<voice drift blank>>
<<flag blank.remnant.visited 1>>
===
